n></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an Enchanted Cottage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room hides secrets waiting to be uncovered, from forgotten chambers to mysterious magical artefacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323120/extras/9212abc158b529730eae56dfbf0d6c40.poster.avif?t=1787588383\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323120/extras/9212abc158b529730eae56dfbf0d6c40.webm?t=1787588383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323120/extras/9212abc158b529730eae56dfbf0d6c40.mp4?t=1787588383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings, combine items, and use logic and magic to solve interconnected escape-room puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323120/extras/aeb9d8a39fc0171fb6a87a7d6c200331.poster.avif?t=1787588383\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323120/extras/aeb9d8a39fc0171fb6a87a7d6c200331.webm?t=1787588383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323120/extras/aeb9d8a39fc0171fb6a87a7d6c200331.mp4?t=1787588383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape Grimazel's Cottage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine everything you've learned to uncover the cottage's final secrets and make your escape before Grimazel returns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323120/extras/4350a6dd9b0f44ec64460e83f8bdc130.poster.avif?t=1787588383\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323120/extras/4350a6dd9b0f44ec64460e83f8bdc130.webm?t=1787588383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323120/extras/4350a6dd9b0f44ec64460e83f8bdc130.mp4?t=1787588383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape from Grimazel's Cottage</strong> is a first-person point-and-click escape-room adventure where you'll master ancient magic, craft enchanted wands, uncover forgotten spells, and solve interconnected puzzles to escape an enchanted witch's home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft enchanted wands using forgotten recipes and harness magic to overcome obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn unique ancient spells to reveal hidden secrets, unlock new paths, and solve magical puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve interconnected escape-room puzzles by combining items, observing your surroundings, and thinking logically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-painted enchanted cottage, where every room has been individually crafted and hides magical mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden passages, forgotten clues, and magical artefacts as you uncover the cottage's secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape before Grimazel returns by combining everything you've learned to find your way to freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\